message: "If you use this template, please cite it as below."
title: "Insurance Churn Analytics Template: Automated End-to-End Notebook, Report Generator and QA Toolkit"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sains Data UB"
    city: "Malang"
    country: ID
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end, data-agnostic analytics template for insurance customer churn (lapse, surrender, non-renewal).
  A single Jupyter notebook ingests messy tabular data, runs statistical driver analysis, survival analysis,
  interpretable regression, a cross-validated machine-learning ensemble, doubly robust causal inference and
  campaign economics, and writes a formatted article with appendices, an interactive dashboard and a submission file.
  Tools cover case setup, research planning, headless execution, stress testing on 44 data variants,
  automatic article QA and an AI-writing-style audit.
keywords:
  - insurance
  - customer churn
  - lapse
  - survival analysis
  - causal inference
  - machine learning
  - explainable AI
  - reproducible research
